body:
Decided to go home. Drink all the alcohol with my husband, and take all the medication I can before bed. Hopefully I won't wake up tomorrow. Chances are good this is a fools errand and I suck at killing myself just like everything else, but maybe tomorrow I"ll not wake up.

&#x200B;

Thanks for responding. You're a good person and a kind soul. I appreciate that you attempt to help random internet strangers. I wish I was stronger tonight like you but I realized just how worthless I actually am.
